      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "今天是5月20日，我看见很多人买花送给他们的女朋友。",
      "traditional": "今天是5月20日，我看見很多人買花送給他們的女朋友。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì 1 yuè 2 rì wǒ kàn jiàn hěn duō rén mǎi huā sòng gěi tā men de nǚ péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我问小雨为什么，小雨说：“因为‘520’听起来像‘我爱你’，",
      "traditional": "我問小雨為什麼，小雨說：“因為‘520’聽起來像‘我愛你’，",
      "pinyin": "wǒ wèn xiǎo yǔ wèi shén me xiǎo yǔ shuō yīn wèi 3 tīng qǐ lái xiàng wǒ ài nǐ",
      "english": "Today is May 20th. I saw a lot of people buy flowers to give to their girlfriends."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "中国人喜欢买花给女朋友，和她们说‘我爱你’”。",
      "traditional": "中國人喜歡買花給女朋友，和她們說‘我愛你’”。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó rén xǐ huan mǎi huā gěi nǚ péng you hé tā men shuō wǒ ài nǐ",
      "english": "I asked Little Yu why, and she said: “Because ‘520’ sounds like ‘I love you.’”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Chinese people like to buy flowers for their girlfriends, to tell them ‘I love you.’”"
    }
